    "The £260 payment and the separate £20 cash gift from Robyn Ellis at the December collection event are two distinct transactions; this analysis covers only the £260 February payment as specified. The £20 gift would require a separate eligibility determination.",
    "The booking correspondence and coordinator records raise a factual question about whether the £260 constitutes payment for advertising services (newsletter link and homepage placement) rather than a donation, which directly affects atom a6 and therefore whether Gift Aid can be claimed at all. This is a scope issue that must be resolved on the facts before the eligibility expression can be evaluated."
  ],
