    "The passages do not specify the precise form or content required for a valid Gift Aid declaration (atom a4) beyond the requirement that it gives permission to claim.",
    "The passages do not address whether volunteering by the donor constitutes a 'benefit' for the purposes of E11.",
    "Whether Robyn Ellis paid sufficient Income Tax or Capital Gains Tax in the 2025-26 tax year (atom a3) and whether she completed a Gift Aid declaration for the £260 (atom a4) are expressly noted as unchecked in the scenario."
